          "text": "The moment before William open Charles’s Room, his hand reaching out toward the tarnished brass handle. ",
          "pacing": 0.045,
          "style": "narration",
          "pause_after": 0.3
        },
        {
          "text": "Before his fingers can close around it, the air in the hallway turns freezing cold.",
